            "en": "E1:\nPretty good gives Kyrken's Apostle more damage and also 1 AP for setup\nE2:\nAbsolutely broken, 20% Final damage and 4 attacks for free for existing\nE3:\n30% more fixed damage from the Flicker Nuke is pretty good\nE4:\nUp to 40% Multi very easy to max as well\nE5:\nRW has very high base Multipliers, so potential levels are good\nE6:\nMore free Final damage and now Dark and Light doesn't matter for Hand Size is crazy"
